message: "If you use this software or map, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "sg-streetpoints: Interactive web map of Singapore's lamp posts and bus stops"
abstract: >-
  A web map of Singapore LTA lamp posts, SLA lamp posts and LTA bus stops,
  built with QGIS and qgis2web from open data on data.gov.sg. A GitHub Action
  refreshes the data monthly and republishes the map to GitHub Pages.
type: software
authors:
